    "title": "קוֹל אָהֳלָה | Qōl Ohalah — reshut №9 from the Old Sefaradi Tiqun for Shabbat Ḥazon, by Haḇiḇ ben Yitsḥaq Toledano",
    "author": "Isaac Gantwerk Mayer (transcription &amp; naqdanut)",
    "coauthors": [
        {
            "name": "Isaac Gantwerk Mayer (transcription &amp; naqdanut)",
            "bio": "From a family of musicians, Isaac Gantwerk Mayer believes that creative art is one of the most powerful ways to get in touch with the divine. He composes music and poetry in Hebrew and English. (He also <a href=\"/index.php?user_ID=342\">translates</a> and <a href=\"/index.php?user_ID=2240\">authors</a> his own original works.) Isaac runs a Jewish music transcription service, which will transcribe and set any Jewish music in any language, recorded or written. Contact his service on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/isaacgmayerjewishtranscription/\">Facebook</a> or via <a href=\"https://igmjewishcreativeworks.com/contact\">his music blog</a>.",
            "website": "https://igmjewishcreativeworks.com",
            "avatar": "https://opensiddur.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/12/isaac-gantwerk-mayer-2021-e1674561264977-96x96.jpg",
            "profile_link": "https://opensiddur.org/profile/isaac-gantwerk-mayer-transcription"
        },
        {
            "name": "Isaac Gantwerk Mayer (translation)",
            "bio": "From a family of musicians, Isaac Gantwerk Mayer believes that creative art is one of the most powerful ways to get in touch with the divine. He composes music and poetry in Hebrew and English.  (He also <a href=\"/index.php?user_ID=2240\">authors</a> his own original works and <a href=\"/index.php?user_ID=820\">transcribes</a> Hebrew and Aramaic text, adding niqqud and t'amim as needed.) Isaac runs a Jewish music transcription service, which will transcribe and set any Jewish music in any language, recorded or written. Contact his service on <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/isaacgmayerjewishtranscription/\">Facebook</a> or via <a href=\"https://igmjewishcreativeworks.com/contact\">his music blog</a>.",
